{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA_n2000 encoding without image input or fusion, establishing a baseline for RNA representation alone. Validation accuracy of 0.485 and F1 of 0.464 suggest moderate performance, but no direct comparison exists to assess the impact of multimodal components. The role of RNA encoding complexity and potential interactions with image data remain uncertain without additional experimental context."
}

